# Tool-local ignore list (fd, ripgrep, and other search tools). Git does not
# read this file, so it is safe for cases where a path must stay trackable.
#
# uv.lock is deliberately NOT in .gitignore or .git/info/exclude: it must remain
# visible to Git so it can be tracked and updated normally. Search tools should
# still skip it, which is what the entry below does.

uv.lock
